<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HOS" style="id">- Ibibio Contemporary Bible 2025 (Ñwed Abasi ke Ikọ Ibibio Ayo Mfịn)</book>
  <para style="rem">Copyright © 2020, 2025 by Biblica, Inc.®</para>
  <para style="h">Hosie</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hosie</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hosie</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hos</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hosie</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HOS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 1:1" />Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-akebịneke Hosie ayịn Beeri ke ini ukara Usaiya, Yọtam, Ahas ye Hesikaiya, ndidem Yuda, ye ke ini ukara Yerobuam ayịn Yehoas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru Yoas asʌk ado Yehoas</char></note> adidem Isrel.<verse eid="HOS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Anwaan Hosie ye Nditọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 1:2" />Ke ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketọọñọke adiboiyo ke inua Hosie ntañ ikọ, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo anye ate, “Kaa, kedọ awonwaan akpara nyʌñ bon nditọ to anye, sia kpa nte anwaan efịbe, isọñ ami adue ke unana adinam akpanikọ nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.” <verse eid="HOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 1:3" />Ndin anye amaadọ Koma ayịn Diblaim, ndin anye amaayommo anyʌñ aman ayịn anọ anye.<verse eid="HOS 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 1:4" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Hosie, “Koot anye Yesriil, sia ami ñyaasọp mmia ufọk Yehu ufen ke adaña udịm awo e-ekewotto afai-afai ke Yesriil, ndin ami ñyaanam ukara Isrel anie utịd. <verse eid="HOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 1:5" />Ke usen ado ami ñyaabuuñ utịgha Isrel ke Abedeñ Yesriil.”<verse eid="HOS 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 1:6" />Koma amaamaana ayommo anyʌñ aman ayịn awonwaan. Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Hosie, “Koot anye Lo-Ruhama,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lo-Ruhama </char><char style="ft" closed="false">awuọñọ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">awo imaaha.</char></note> sia ami ndiiwọttọ Isrel ima mmi aba, ndiinyʌññọ ndakka nnọ ammọ. <verse eid="HOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 1:7" />Kpayeado, ami ñyaawọt Yuda ima; ami ñyaanyaaña ammọ, itooho ke utịgha, akañkañ, me ekọñ, me ke enañmbakara ye mme awad enañmbakara, ado ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ, ñyaanyaaña ammọ.”<verse eid="HOS 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 1:8" />Ke ini anye amaakesio Lo-Ruhama ke eba, Koma amaanie ayịn awodeen mfen. <verse eid="HOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 1:9" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, “Koot anye Lo-Ammi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lo-Ammi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">awuọñọ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">idooho mbon mmi.</char></note>, sia ndufo idooho idịd mmi, ami ñko ndooho Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="HOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 1:10" />“Kpayeado, nditọ Isrel ediibit ntan ke mben inyañ, a-adooho awo ikanna idomo inyʌññọ ikan ibat. Ke itie e-ekebooho ammọ, ‘Ndufo idooho ikọd mmi,’ eyaekoot ammọ ‘nditọ aduuwem Abasi.’ <verse eid="HOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 1:11" />Mbon Yuda ye mbon Isrel eyaediana keed; ammọ eyaesio adadusʌñ keed, eyaenyʌñ ewuọ ekpọñ isọñ, sia usen Yesriil<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke mme ikpañwed Hibru ewet Hos 1:10, 11 nte Hos 2:1, 2.</char></note> ayaakpon.<verse eid="HOS 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HOS 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">2: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke mme ikpañwed Hibru ewet Hos 2:1-23 nte Hos 2:3-25.</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 2:1" />“Tañ baña nditọeka mfo ideen, ‘Mbon mmi,’ ye nditọeka mfo ibaan, ‘Mme ndima mmi.’<verse eid="HOS 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emia Isrel Ufen Emaana Enọ Ammọ Itie</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 2:2" />“Sua nọ eka mfo, sua nọ anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:2">sia anye idooho anwaan mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:2">ami ñko ñnyʌññọ ndo ebe amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:2">Yak anye atre adikama iso nte awonwaan efịbe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:2">ye unana akpanikọ ke ufọọd eba amọ.<verse eid="HOS 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 2:3" />Imiidooho ntoro ami ñyaasuuk anye ifed</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:3">ñnyʌñ nnam anye aba nte usen e-ekemanna anye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:3">ami ñyaanam anye aba nte akpautatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:3">nnam anye akappa aba nte nsaad isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:3">ñnyʌñ mmia anye ufen ye nsaditọñ.<verse eid="HOS 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 2:4" />Ami ndiiwọttọ nditọ amọ ima mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:4">sia ammọ edo nditọ efịbe.<verse eid="HOS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 2:5" />Eka ammọ inamma akpanikọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:5">anyʌñ ayommo ammọ ke asuenne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:5">Anye amaabo, ‘Ami ñyaakaa mbịne mbon ima mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:5">mbon se innọọ miin ndidia ye mmọọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:5">afọñ idededọñ ye linen mmi, adan ọlif mmi ye ukọd mmi.’<verse eid="HOS 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 2:6" />Ke ntoro ami ñyaafak usʌñ amọ ye ikọd ñkukịm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:6">ami ñyaakọọk akọ nsịn anye mbaak anye adidiọọñọ usʌñ amọ.<verse eid="HOS 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 2:7" />Anye ayaabịne mbon ima amọ ado idiisịmeke ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:7">anye ayaayem ammọ ado idiikịtte ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:7">Ndin anye ayaabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:7">‘Ami ñyaatịmme mbịne ebe mmi naña akedo ke ntọọñọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:7">sia idaha ado amamfọn miin akan naña ado idahami.’<verse eid="HOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 2:8" />Anye inamma nọ ediọọñọ ke ami ñkedo awo ado,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:8">a-akenọọhọ anye ñkwa abakpa, ufa ukọd ye adan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:8">a-akenwaññake silfa ye kold afʌk anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:8">a-ammọ ekekamake enam ñkpọ enọ Baal.<verse eid="HOS 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 2:9" />“Ke ntoro ami ñyaabọ anye ñkwa abakpa mmi ke amaadat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:9">ye ufa ukọd mmi ke emaenam ema.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:9">Ami ñyaatịmme mben idededọñ mmi ye linen mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:9">a-akenaaha eben efʌk ifed amọ.<verse eid="HOS 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 2:10" />Ke ntoro ami ñyaayaara ifed amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:10">ke iso mbon ima amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:10">awo ndomokeed idiimbọọhọ anye ke ubọk mmi.<verse eid="HOS 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 2:11" />Ami ñyaatre afịd mme usọrọ amọ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:11">mme usọrọ afịd isua amọ, mme Ufa Afiọñ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:11">mme usen Sabad amọ, afịd mme usọrọ amọ.<verse eid="HOS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 2:12" />Ami ñyaabiat mme fain amọ ye mme eto fik amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:12">a-anye akebooho ke akedo ekọmudua se mbon ima amọ ekenọọ anye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:12">ami ñyaanam ammọ ekappa edo akai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:12">ndin ndiọi unam ikọd eyaeta ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 2:13" />Ami ñyaamia anye ufen ke mme usen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:13">se anye akefọp insensi anọ mme Baal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:13">anye amaabana idem amọ ke mme ñkpannuun ubọk ye ñkpọ mmaidem amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:13">anyʌñ abịne mbon ima amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:13">ado anye amamfre miin,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="HOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 2:14" />“Ke ntoro idahami ami ñyaatap anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:14">ami ñyaadat anye usʌñ ñkaa nsaad isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:14">ñnyʌñ ntañ ikọ ye anye ke sʌñ-sʌñ uyio.<verse eid="HOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 2:15" />Do ami ñyaamaana ñyaak mme inwañ fain amọ nnọ anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:15">ñyaanyʌñ nnam Abedeñ Akọọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Akọọ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">awuọñọ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ntịme.</char></note> akappa ado usʌñ idodanyen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:15">Do ke anye adiimaana iba naña anye akeba ke ini uyịn amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:15">kpa nte usen a-anye akewuọhọ akpọñ Iyib.<verse eid="HOS 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 2:16" />“Ke usen ado,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:16">“afo ayañkoot miin ‘ebe mmi’;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:16">afo uduumaanake uñkoot miin ‘eteufọk mmi.’<verse eid="HOS 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 2:17" />Ami ñyaasio anyịñ mme Baal mfep ke inua amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:17">awo idiitommoke anyịñ ammọ aba.<verse eid="HOS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 2:18" />Ke usen ado ami ñyaanam edioomo nnọ ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:18">ye mme unam ke inwañ, mme inuen ke anyọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:18">ye mme unam se isaaña ke isọñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:18">Utịgha ye akañkañ ye ekọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:18">ami ñyaasio ammọ mfep ke iso isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:18">nọ ato do afịd awo esuuk ena ke ifuuro.<verse eid="HOS 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 2:19" />Ami ñyauyaak fiin nnọ idem mmi ke ndọ ke nsi-nsi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:19">ami ñyauyaak fiin nnọ ndọ ke adinenido ye unen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:19">ke ima ye mbọm.<verse eid="HOS 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HOS 2:20" />Ami ñyauyaak fiin nnọ ke mbuọdidem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:20">afo ñko ayaadiọọñọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="HOS 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HOS 2:21" />“Ke usen ado ami ñyaabọọrọ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:21">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:21">“Ami ñyaabọọrọ mme ikpaanyọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:21">ammọ ñko eyaebọọrọ ederimbod;<verse eid="HOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HOS 2:22" />ndin ederimbod ayaabọọrọ ñkpasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:22">ufa ukọd ye adan ọlif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:22">ndin ammọ eyaebọọrọ Yesriil<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yesriil </char><char style="ft" closed="false">awuọñọ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Abasi atọ.</char></note>.<verse eid="HOS 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HOS 2:23" />Ami ñyaatọ anye nnọ idem mmi nte inwañ ke abio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:23">ami ñyaawọt ima mmi nnọ anye a-ami ñkekoodo ‘Idooho awoima mmi.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:23">Ami ñyaabo mbon se ekoot ‘Idooho mbon mmi,’ ‘Ndufo edo mbon mmi’;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 2:23">ammọ ñko eyaebo, ‘Afo ado Abasi ñnyịn.’ ”<verse eid="HOS 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HOS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Hosie Anam Emem ye Anwaan Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 3:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Kaa, maana kewọt anwaan mfo ima, akpesʌkado awodeen mfen amaaha anye, ndin anye ñko anyʌñ ado asịn efịbe. Ma anye naña Abasi ama mbon Isrel, akpesʌkado a-ammọ ekannake iso ekeene mme abasi mfen enyʌñ ema adita ndisana nsaad ndomuyo.”<verse eid="HOS 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 3:2" />Ndin ami mmaadep anye ke sekel silfa duob mme ition<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kram 170</char></note> ye homa baali keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Homa akenie udob ñkpọ nte kilokram 195.</char></note>, ye ubaak homa baali. <verse eid="HOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 3:3" />Akem ami mmaadọkkọ anye, “Ana afo adʌñ ye ami ke uwak usen; inaaha afo ado akpara, inyʌññọ ina anie ewuana ye awodeen ndomokeed, ami ñko ñyaanyʌñ nnam ntoro ye afo.”<verse eid="HOS 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 3:4" />Sia nditọ Isrel eyaedʌñ uwak usen ado inieghe adidem me akpanabọọñ, inamma uwa inyʌññọ inie ndisana itiad, inyʌññọ inie afọñ aboditọñ me mme abasi ufọk. <verse eid="HOS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 3:5" />Ke ado amaaboiyo mbon Isrel eyaetịmme ebịne enyʌñ eyem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ ye ake Defid adidem ammọ. Ammọ eyaebịne <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ñnyeñidem, enyʌñ ebọ adidiọñ amọ ke mme akpatre usen.<verse eid="HOS 3:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HOS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ubiomikpe Isrel Anam</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 4:1" />Ikop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndufo mbon Isrel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:1">sia Abọọñ anie ikpe a-anye aduakka ikoot ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:1">mbon se idʌñ ke isọñ ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:1">“Akpanikọ ndomokeed, ima ndomokeed,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:1">ifiọk Abasi ndomokeed ibaaha ke isọñ ami.<verse eid="HOS 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 4:2" />Isuuñọ ikpọọñ, nsu ye uwodawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:2">uyịbinọ ye efịbe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:2">ammọ ebiat afịd ewʌhọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:2">uduọkiyiib anyʌñ akeene uduọkiyiib.<verse eid="HOS 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 4:3" />Ato ke ntak ami isọñ asat afịd ama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:3">afịd mbon se idʌñ ke esịd enyʌñ ebiaña ema;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:3">mme unam ikọd, mme inuen ke anyọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:3">ye mme iyak ke mmọọñ eboiyo efep.<verse eid="HOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 4:4" />“Ado ke awo ndomokeed akoot awo ikpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:4">ke awo ndomokeed abiom emọ-emọ awo ikpe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:4">sia mbon mfo eba nte mbon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:4">e-ekoodo aku ikpe.<verse eid="HOS 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 4:5" />Afo aduọ uweemeayio ye akonayio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:5">mme prọfed ñko enyʌñ eduọ ye afo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:5">Ke ntoro ami ñyaasobo eka mfo,<verse eid="HOS 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 4:6" />esobo ikọd mmi akeene unana ifiọk.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HOS 4:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:6">“Sia ndufo emaesịn ifiọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:6">ami ñko mme nyʌñ isịn ndufo nte mme aku mmi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:6">sia ndufo esịnne mbed Abasi ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:6">ami ñko ndiiseeghe nditọ ndufo.<verse eid="HOS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 4:7" />Naña mme aku ekewak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:7">kpa ntoro ke ammọ ekenam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:7">ammọ eben ubọọñ Abasi ammọ ekpəho ye ñkpọ asuenne.<verse eid="HOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 4:8" />Ammọ edia mme idiọọkñkpọ ikọd mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:8">enyʌñ ekop inem ke ibak ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 4:9" />Ndin adiido: Nte mme idịd, nte mme aku.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:9">Ami ñyaamia ammọ naña iba ufen ñkeene mme usʌñ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:9">ñnyʌñ nnọ ammọ utịb ñkeene mme adinam ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 4:10" />“Ammọ eyaedia ñkpọ ado ikoppo uyʌkkọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:10">ammọ eyaesaña akpara ado iforoke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:10">sia ammọ ekpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:10">enyʌñ esaana idem ammọ eyaak <verse eid="HOS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 4:11" />enọ usaña akpara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:11">akaan ukọd ye ufa ukọd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:11">abọ ammọ ifiọk.<verse eid="HOS 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 4:12" />Ikọd mmi eka useñkpọ eto usọsọi eto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:12">eto abia ñkukịd ñko atañ ikọ anọ ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:12">Sịbidịd akpara anyʌñ atịn ammọ usʌñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:12">ammọ inamma akpanikọ ye Abasi ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 4:13" />Ammọ enam uwa ke mme anyọñ ikpọabod</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:13">enyʌñ efọp uwa ke anyọñ ntək abod,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:13">ke idak afriyo, pọpla ye terebin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:13">ke idak mfuud i-inem abaaha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:13">Ke ntoro nditọ ibaan mfo ewọññọ ekeene usaña akpara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:13">ibaan nditọ mfo ideen ñko enyʌñ esịn efịbe.<verse eid="HOS 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 4:14" />“Ami ndiimiaha nditọ ibaan mfo ufen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:14">ke ini ammọ ewọññọke esaña akpara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:14">mme ibaan nditọ ideen ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:14">ke ini ammọ esịnne efịbe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:14">sia ideen ke idem ammọ e-eka ebịne ibaan akpara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:14">enyʌñ enam uwa ke akpokoro uwa mme akpara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:14">mbon awo i-imiinieghe ifiọk eyaetak!<verse eid="HOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 4:15" />“Akpesʌkado a-afo, Isrel asịnne efịbe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:15">kuuyak Yuda anam utọ ndudue ado.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HOS 4:15" />
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:15">“Kuukaa Kilkal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:15">kuunyʌñ ukaa Bed Afen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bed Afen </char><char style="ft" closed="false">awuọñọ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ufọk ibak </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a-adooho anyịñ nsappa e-ekoodo Beteel, awuọñọke </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ufọk Abasi.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:15">Kuunyʌñ unwọñọ ubo, ‘Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem!’<verse eid="HOS 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 4:16" />Nditọ Isrel edo mbon ntreutọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:16">nte atreutọñ ñyịn umanenañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 4:16">Die ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeme adikama ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:16">nte nditọedọñ ke inwañ mbid?<verse eid="HOS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 4:17" />Ifrem a-akeene adiana ke ukpono mme ubobodñkpọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:17">saana anye yaak!<verse eid="HOS 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 4:18" />Ke idem ini a-mmịn akpọññọ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:18">ammọ ekaka iso ke usaña akpara ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:18">mbọọñ ammọ enekke ema mme ido abuud.<verse eid="HOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 4:19" />Afịm ayobio ayaafịm ammọ aduọọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 4:19">mme uwa ammọ eyaeben asuenne esọk ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HOS 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ubiereikpe Nnọ Isrel</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 5:1" />“Ikop ami, ndufo mme aku!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:1">Ikpañ utọñ, ndufo nditọ Isrel!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:1">Inekke ikop, ndufo ufọk mbọọñ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:1">Ubiereikpe ami inie ndufo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:1">Ndufo emedo afia ke Mispa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:1">iyịre e-etatta efʌk Tabọ.<verse eid="HOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 5:2" />Mbon nsọñiwuod enyenyịne ke uwot awo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:2">Ami ñyaatʌnọ afịd ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 5:3" />Ami mmediọọñọ afịd ñkpọ mbaña Ifrem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:3">Isrel ñko idịbeke ke iso mmi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:3">Ifrem, idahami afo amekeene asaña akpara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:3">Isrel ñko abiara.<verse eid="HOS 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 5:4" />“Mme adinam ammọ iyakka ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:4">etịmme ebịne Abasi ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:4">Sịbidịd akpara a-asịne ammọ ke esịd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:4">ammọ inyịmmeke adidiọọñọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="HOS 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 5:5" />Ñkokkoidem Isrel a-atie ntiense anọ ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:5">nditọ Isrel, ñkọrọ Ifrem, eduọ ke idiọọkñkpọ ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:5">Yuda ñko anyʌñ aduọ ye ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 5:6" />Ke ini ammọ esañake ye mme edọñ ye mme ufene ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:6">eka adiyem iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:6">ammọ idiikịtte anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:6">anye amaasioño idem akpọñ ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 5:7" />Ammọ inamma akpanikọ inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:7">ammọ eman nditọ i-imiitooho ndọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:7">Ke ini ammọ ediaha mme usọrọ Ufa Afiọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:7">anye ayaabiat mme inwañ ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 5:8" />“Fịt adukpoñ ke Kibie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:8">fịt nnʌk ke Rama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:8">Sio uyio ñkpo ekọñ ke Bed Afịn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:8">dat usʌñ, Benyamin.<verse eid="HOS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 5:9" />Eyaenịm Ifrem ifed</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:9">ke usen ikpe amaakem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:9">Ke afịd esiin Isrel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:9">ami mmetañ anwa-anwa se ido akpanikọ.<verse eid="HOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 5:10" />Mme adadusʌñ ke Yuda eba nte mbon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:10">esịkkeke mme itiad adaña.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:10">Ami ñyaanwañña iyadesịd mmi mfʌk ammọ ke idem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:10">nte udiọhọ mmọọñ.<verse eid="HOS 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 5:11" />E-efiik Ifrem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:11">e-esọnnọ anye ke ikpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:11">ye udọñ adibịne mme ubobodñkpọ.<verse eid="HOS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 5:12" />Ami mba nte utañkpọ nnọ Ifrem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:12">nte mbiaña ñkpọ nnọ mbon Yuda.<verse eid="HOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 5:13" />“Ke ini Ifrem akekịtte udọñọ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:13">Yuda ñko anyʌñ akịt mme inia amọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:13">Ifrem amaawọññọ abịne Asiria,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:13">anyʌñ adọọk abịne ekamba adidem nọ anọ unwam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:13">Ado anye ikanna ukọk fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:13">inyʌññọ ikan ikọk mme inia mfo.<verse eid="HOS 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 5:14" />Sia ami ndiiba nte ekpe nnọ Ifrem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:14">nte ekamba ekpe nnọ Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:14">Ami ñyaawai ammọ mbai-mbai, ñnyʌñ nsaña mboiyo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:14">ami ñyaatañ ammọ nsio, awo ndomokeed idiinyaañake ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 5:15" />Ndin ami ñyaanyọñ itie nnaa mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:15">tutu ammọ enyịmme ndudue ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:15">enyʌñ eyem iso mmi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 5:15">ke ini ndutʌhọ ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 5:15">ammọ eyaenekke eñyem miin ke akpan.”<verse eid="HOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HOS 6" />
  <para style="s1">Isrel Ikappake Esịd</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 6:1" />“Idi, yak ñnyịn itịmme ibịne <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:1">Anye i-ikpok ñnyịn mbai-mbai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:1">ado anye ayaikọk ñnyịn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:1">anye i-inọ ñnyịn unan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:1">ado anye ayaanyʌñ abọp mme unan ñnyịn.<verse eid="HOS 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 6:2" />Usen iba amaaboiyo anye ayaidemme ñnyịn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:2">anye ayaamaana inọ ñnyịn itie ke ayọhọ usen ita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:2">nọ ñnyịn iba ke iso amọ.<verse eid="HOS 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 6:3" />Yak ñnyịn idiọọñọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:3">yak ñnyịn isịn ifịk idiọọñọ anye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:3">Adaña nte anaaha utịn asakka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:3">anye ayaabiọññọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:3">anye ayaadi ibịne ñnyịn nte edịm ini winta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:3">nte edịm ke akemini a-aduọkkọke anọ isọñ mmọọñ.”<verse eid="HOS 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 6:4" />“Nsoo ke ami ñkpenam ye afo, Ifrem?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:4">Nsoo ke ami ñkpenam ye afo, Yuda?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:4">Ima mfo aba nte ntuhube ubakusen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:4">nte mbara usiere i-imiikpeeneke anye asop.<verse eid="HOS 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 6:5" />Ke ntoro ami mmaukpịkke fiin mbai-mbai ye mme prọfed mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:5">ami mmauwot fiin ye ikọ inua mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:5">ndin mme ubiideikpe mmi esaña nte ayio.<verse eid="HOS 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 6:6" />Sia ami ñyem mbọm, idooho uwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:6">ye adidiọọñọ Abasi, idooho ufọfọb uwa.<verse eid="HOS 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 6:7" />Aketo ke Adam, ammọ ebiat edioomo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:7">ammọ ikinamma akpanikọ ye ami ke ndo.<verse eid="HOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 6:8" />Kilied ado abio mme anam ndiọi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:8">ikpadisañ ammọ ayọhọ ye iyiib.<verse eid="HOS 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 6:9" />Nte mme inọ e-eyooño eyem mbon se ammọ emʌm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:9">kpa ntoro ke mme aku enam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:9">ammọ ewot awo ke usʌñ Sekem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:9">enam ndiọi akikere ibak ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 6:10" />Ami mmekịt aniendịk ñkpọ ke Isrel:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:10">Do ke Ifrem ayịre ke usaña akpara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:10">emaesappa Isrel.<verse eid="HOS 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 6:11" />“Anyem unie fiin, Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 6:11">u-umek enịm enọ ini idọk.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HOS 6:11" />
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 6:11">“Ini akeedodo a-ami ndiimaana ñyaak mfọnọñkpọ mbon mmi nnọ ikọd mmi,<verse eid="HOS 6:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HOS 7" />
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 7:1" />ini keed akeedodo a-ami ñkọkkọ Isrel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:1">ndiọiñkpọ Ifrem ena anwa-anwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:1">e-enyʌñ eyaara mme ndudue Sameria.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:1">Ammọ enam abiaña,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:1">mme inọ e-ebom mme ufọk edʌk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:1">mbon ñwo enyʌñ ebọ mme awo ñkpọ ke mme usʌñ;<verse eid="HOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 7:2" />ado ammọ idiọọñọke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:2">ke ami mmetoiyo afịd ndiọi adinam ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:2">Ndiọiñkpọ ammọ ekanna ammọ ekʌk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:2">ammọ ena inwañ-inwañ ke iso mmi.<verse eid="HOS 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 7:3" />“Ammọ enem adidem esịd eto mme ibak ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:3">ñkparawa ubọọñ ye mme nsu ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 7:4" />Afịd ammọ edo mme asịn efịbe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:4">e-esakka nte ikañ ofịn</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:4">ikañ a-mme atem uyo imiikpaaha idem adibara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:4">tọọñọ ke ini enuakkake ndomuyo tutu anye adakka ada.<verse eid="HOS 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 7:5" />Ke usen usọrọ adidem ñnyịn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:5">mme akpanabọọñ eyʌkkọ ye ukọd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:5">anye anyʌñ adiana keed ye mbon nsaha.<verse eid="HOS 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 7:6" />Esịd ammọ eba nte ikañ ofịn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:6">ammọ esaña ebịne anye ye ñkara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:6">Udọñ ammọ asak usʌk-usʌk nte ndubek ikañ afịd akonayio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:6">ke usiere anye asak nte ikañ afai.<verse eid="HOS 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 7:7" />Afịd ammọ efiop nte ofịn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:7">ammọ ewowot mbọọñ ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:7">Afịd mme ndidem ammọ eduọññọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:7">awo ammọ ndomokeed iñkoodo miin.<verse eid="HOS 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 7:8" />“Ifrem awuaha ye mme idịd mfen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:8">Ifrem ado ñkpakpa-ñkpakpa uyo a-awo idiikannake ikʌp.<verse eid="HOS 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 7:9" />Mme isenawo efiip adudu amọ esio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:9">ado anye idiọọñọke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:9">E-esiime anye ntọñ ke ided,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:9">ado anye idiọọñọke.<verse eid="HOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 7:10" />Ñkokkoidem Isrel ado ntiense anọ anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:10">ado kpa ye afịd ami</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:10">anye itịmmeke ibịne <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:10">inyʌññọ iyem anye.<verse eid="HOS 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 7:11" />“Ifrem atie nte ibiom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:11">inieghe ifiọk ndin amem utom adibiaña anye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:11">idahami akoot Iyib,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:11">akem awọññọ abịne Asiria.<verse eid="HOS 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 7:12" />Ammọ emaekaa, ami ñyaatop iyịre mmi mfʌk ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:12">ami ñyaadʌt ammọ nte inuen ke ikpaanyọñ nduọọk ke isọñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:12">Ami mmaakop naña ammọ eboho keed</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:12">ami ñyaamʌm ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 7:13" />Adọdiọọk anọ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:13">sia ammọ eyooñ eñkpọñ miin!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:13">Nsobo anie ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:13">sia ammọ esọñ iwuod ye ami!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:13">Ami mmenie udọñ adifak ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:13">ado ammọ etañ nsu-nsu ikọ endian miin.<verse eid="HOS 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 7:14" />Ammọ ituaha ayịd ke awọñesịd ammọ innọ miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:14">ado etua ke akpọsọñ uyio ke ñkpana ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:14">Ammọ esai idem ammọ, eseeme ekoot mme abasi ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:14">eyem ñkwa abakpa ye ufa ukọd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:14">ado ammọ ewọññọ eñkpọñ miin.<verse eid="HOS 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 7:15" />Ami mmaakpeep ammọ ñnyʌñ nsọọñọ ammọ ubọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:15">ado ammọ eduak idiọọk embaña miin.<verse eid="HOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 7:16" />Ammọ ikannake ibịne Andikoñ Ñkan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:16">ammọ ebit utịgha a-abiarake.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:16">Akañkañ ayaadia mme adadusʌñ ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:16">ke ntak mme ikọ usọñanyen ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 7:16">Ke ntak ami eyaekama ammọ enam ñkpọ ndọk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 7:16">ke isọñ Iyib.<verse eid="HOS 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HOS 8" />
  <para style="s1">Isrel Adiidọk Ayobio</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 8:1" />“Ben adukpoñ dian ke inua mfo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:1">Ntrukpuum mmọ ke anyọñ ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:1">sia mme awo ebiat edioomo mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:1">enyʌñ esọñ iwuod ye mbed mmi.<verse eid="HOS 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 8:2" />Isrel e-etua ennọ miin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:2">‘Abasi ñnyịn, ñnyịn imisuuk iwuod unọ fiin!’<verse eid="HOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 8:3" />Ado Isrel asịn se ido eti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:3">asua ayaabịne anye.<verse eid="HOS 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 8:4" />Ammọ emek mbọọñ ibọọhọ unyịmme into miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:4">ammọ emek ñkparawa ubọọñ a-ami mmennọọhọ unyịmme.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:4">Ye silfa mme kold ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:4">ammọ enam ubobod ñkpọ enọ idem ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:4">ebeeñe nsobo ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 8:5" />Sameria, top ubobod enañ mfo duọọk!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:5">Iyadesịd mmi a-asak nte ikañ abaña ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:5">Adiikpeene die mbemiso ndufo etre usappa idem ndufo?<verse eid="HOS 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 8:6" />Ammọ eto Isrel!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:6">Ubobod enañ ami, anam utomusọ abot anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:6">idooho Abasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:6">Enañ Sameria ado,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:6">eyaebom anye mbai-mbai.<verse eid="HOS 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 8:7" />“Ammọ etọ afịm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:7">enyʌñ edọk ayobio.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:7">Eto abakpa inieghe iwuod;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:7">anye ikemeke inam ndomuyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:7">Akpedo anye amaanwịm mfịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:7">Isenawo ekpaekemen anye.<verse eid="HOS 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 8:8" />E-eben Isrel emen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:8">idahami anye adiba ke atu mme idịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:8">nte ñkpọ a-awo imiiyemme.<verse eid="HOS 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 8:9" />Sia ammọ edọọk ekaa Asiria</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:9">nte dọñki ikọd ayooño ikpọọñ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:9">Ifrem anyam idem amọ anọ mbon ima amọ.<verse eid="HOS 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 8:10" />Akpesʌkado a-ammọ enyamma idem ammọ ke atu mme idịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:10">idahami ami ñyaatañ ammọ mbok itie keed.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:10">Ammọ eyaetọọñọ adibiaña</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:10">ke idak ufiik ekamba adidem.<verse eid="HOS 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 8:11" />“Akpesʌkado Ifrem amaakebọp uwak akpokoro uwa inọ mme enọ idiọọkñkpọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:11">ammọ ekappa edo akpokoro uwa unam ndiọiñkpọ.<verse eid="HOS 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 8:12" />Ami mmaawet uwak ñkpọ e-ebañake mbed mmi nnọ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:12">ado ammọ ekekịt nte asen ñkpọ.<verse eid="HOS 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 8:13" />Akpesʌkado a-ammọ enamma uwa ennọọ miin nte enọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:13">ñko akpesʌkado a-ammọ etaaha unam ado,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:13">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inemme esịd ye ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:13">Idahami anye ayaatoiyo ibak ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:13">anyʌñ amia ammọ ufen abaña ndiọiñkpọ ammọ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:13">Ammọ eyaetịmme enyọñ Iyib.<verse eid="HOS 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 8:14" />Isrel afre Andibod ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:14">enyʌñ ebọp mme ñkpọsọñ itieidʌñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:14">Yuda anekke asọọñọ uwak idʌñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 8:14">Ado ami ñyaadọñ ikañ aketa mme abio ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 8:14">ikañ adiita mme ñkpọsọñ itie ammọ.”<verse eid="HOS 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HOS 9" />
  <para style="s1">Emia Isrel Ufen</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 9:1" />Isrel, kuunem esịd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:1">kuudaara nte mme idịd mfen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:1">Sia afo unamma akpanikọ ye Abasi mfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:1">afo ama akʌk akpara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:1">ke afịd afe ubeek abakpa.<verse eid="HOS 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 9:2" />Mme afe ubeek abakpa ye mme afe utem ukọd idiinọọhọ mme awo ndidia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:2">ufa ukọd ayaakpu ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 9:3" />Ammọ idiisʌhọke ke isọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:3">Ifrem ayaatịmme anyọñ Iyib,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:3">anyʌñ adia ndedeghe ndidia ke Asiria.<verse eid="HOS 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 9:4" />Ammọ idiiduọkkọ mme enọ ukọd inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:4">uwa ammọ idiinyʌññọ inem anye esịd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:4">Utọ mme uwa ado adiitie nte uyio mbon mfʌhọ anọ ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:4">afịd mbon se idia ammọ ediido ndedeghe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:4">Ndidia ami adiido ake ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:4">Awo idiibenne anye idʌk ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="HOS 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 9:5" />Nsoo ke afo uduunam ke usen mme nsionnịm usọrọ mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:5">ke mme usen usọrọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>?<verse eid="HOS 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 9:6" />Akpesʌkado ammọ efegheke ebọkkọ nsobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:6">Iyib ayaakoono ammọ abono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:6">Memfis ñko ayaabuuk ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:6">Akpab ye mbaraekpe eyaefʌk mme ñkpọuto silfa ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:6">mme ñkukịm eyaefʌk mme atayad ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 9:7" />Mme usen umia ufen esʌk edi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:7">mme usen ikpe ekpere.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:7">Yak Isrel adiọọñọ ami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:7">Sia ndiọiñkpọ mfo ewak eti-eti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:7">ntịme mfo anekke akpon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:7">edat prọfed nte ndisịme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:7">edat akịdñkukịd nte idaad.<verse eid="HOS 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 9:8" />Prọfed, kọrọ ye Abasi mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:8">ado andikpeme Ifrem,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Prọfed </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ado awoukpeme anọ Ifrem, mbon Abasi mmi</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:8">kpayeado mme afia esʌk ebebet anye ke afịd usʌñ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:8">ye usua ke ufọk Abasi amọ.<verse eid="HOS 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 9:9" />Ammọ e-eduọ enyịne ke abʌd-abʌd ido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:9">kpa naña akedo ke mme usen Kibie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:9">Abasi ayaatoiyo mme ibak ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:9">anyʌñ amia ammọ ufen ke mme ndiọiñkpọ ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 9:10" />“Ke ini ami ñkekịtte Isrel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:10">akeba nte awo akịt kreb ke akpautatan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">idaha ami ñkekịtte mme eteete ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:10">akeba nte awo akịt akpa mfịd ke eto fik;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:10">ado ke ini ammọ ekediighe Baal Pọọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:10">ammọ emaenịm idem ammọ asaña-asaña enọ ubobodñkpọ asuenne ado</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:10">enyʌñ eforo mbubiam kpa nte ñkpọ se ammọ ekema.<verse eid="HOS 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 9:11" />Ubọọñ Ifrem ayaafuuro nte inuen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:11">uman ayịn, usaña ye idịb, ye uyommo idịb idiibaaha.<verse eid="HOS 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 9:12" />Akpekọm ammọ ekpebọọbọọk nditọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:12">ami ñyaanam ammọ etua ebaña ñkpañña afịd nditọ ado.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:12">Adọdiọọk anọ ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:12">ke ini ami ñwọññọke edem ñkpọñ ammọ!<verse eid="HOS 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 9:13" />Ami mmekịt Ifrem, nte Tai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:13">e-etọọhọ ke eti itie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:13">Ado Ifrem ayaasio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:13">nditọ ammọ anọ mme awodawo.”<verse eid="HOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 9:14" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nọ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:14">nsoo ke afo adiinọ ammọ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:14">Nọ ammọ idịb a-nditọ awuọñọke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:14">ye eba a-mmọọñeba asatta.<verse eid="HOS 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 9:15" />“Ke ntak afịd ibak ammọ ke Kilkal,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:15">ami mmaasua ammọ do.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:15">Ke ntak ndiọi adinam ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:15">ami ñyaabịn ammọ nsio ke ufọk mmi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:15">Ami ndiimaaha ammọ aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:15">afịd mme adadusʌñ ammọ edo mbon nsọñiwuod.<verse eid="HOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 9:16" />Ifrem akịt mbiara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:16">adʌñ ammọ ayeeme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:16">ammọ inwịmme mfịd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 9:16">Akpekọm ammọ eman nditọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:16">ami ñyaawot mme ndima nditọ ammọ.”<verse eid="HOS 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 9:17" />Abasi mmi ayaasịn ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:17">sia ammọ ikoppo item inọ anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 9:17">ammọ eyaeyooñ ke atu mme idịd.<verse eid="HOS 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="HOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HOS 10" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 10:1" />Isrel akedo fain a-atarake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:1">anye amaanwịm mfịd anọ idem amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:1">Adaña nte mfịd amọ aketọttọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:1">anye amaabọp uwak akpokoro uwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:1">naña isọñ amọ akeseghe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:1">anye amaadiọñ mme itiad ukpono amọ.<verse eid="HOS 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 10:2" />Esịd ammọ ayọhọ ye abiaña,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:2">idahami ana ammọ ebiom ndudue ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:2">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaawuut mme akpokoro uwa ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:2">anyʌñ abiat mme asaña-asaña itiad ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 10:3" />Ndin ammọ eyaebo, “Ñnyịn inieghe adidem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:3">sia ñnyịn ikikponoke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:3">Ado akpekọm a-ñnyịn ikpikineenie adidem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:3">nsoo ke anye akpekekan anam inọọ ñnyịn?”<verse eid="HOS 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 10:4" />Ammọ enam uwak akaaña,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:4">edat mme nsu-nsu unwọñọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:4">enyʌñ enam mme unyịmme;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:4">ke ntoro mme ukoodikpe ewuọñọ edi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:4">nte ndiọi ibak mbid ke inwañ e-emaekekịm ekappa.<verse eid="HOS 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 10:5" />Mme awo e-edʌññọ ke Sameria e-ekop ndịk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:5">ebaña ubobod enañ Bed Afen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:5">Mbon amọ eyaefʌhọ ebaña anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:5">ntoro ñko ye mme aku ammọ e-ekponoke ibọk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:5">mbon e-ekenemme esịd ebaña inie amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:5">sia ekebọọhọ ammọ eben eka itie ntañmfeb.<verse eid="HOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 10:6" />Eyaeben anye ekaa Asiria</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:6">nte mbʌk itooro enọ akwa adidem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:6">Eyaesuenne Ifrem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:6">Isrel ayaakop abuud abaña mme isen item ufan amọ.<verse eid="HOS 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 10:7" />Eyaesobo adidem Sameria,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:7">ekwọọk anye efep nte nsaad mfañ ke anyọñ mmọọñ.<verse eid="HOS 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 10:8" />Eyaesobo mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ibak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:8">sia ado idiọọkñkpọ Isrel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:8">Ñkukịm ye mbaraekpe eyaetịppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:8">enyʌñ efʌk akpokoro uwa ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:8">Ndin ammọ eyaebo mme ekamba abod, “Ifuuk ñnyịn!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:8">enyʌñ ebo mme ntək abod, “Iduọ itọ ñnyịn!”<verse eid="HOS 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 10:9" />“Isrel, tọọñọ ke mme usen Kibie, afo amenam idiọọkñkpọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:9">afo asʌk abaaba ke idiọọkñkpọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:9">Nte ekọñ idiimaanake ibeen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:9">mme anam idiọọkñkpọ ke Kibie?<verse eid="HOS 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 10:10" />Ini amaakem, ami ñyaamia ammọ ufen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:10">mme idịd eyaebono ebaña ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:10">nọ esịn ammọ ifʌn ebaña edemiba idiọọkñkpọ ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 10:11" />Ifrem ado ñyịn enañ e-enọọhọ ukpeeb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:11">a-amaaha adisọnnọ abakpa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:11">ke ntoro ami ñyaadot akpọnọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:11">ke uyaiya itọñ amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:11">Ami ñyaawat Ifrem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:11">Yuda ana akappa isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:11">ndin Yekọb ayaatịppe isọñ.<verse eid="HOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 10:12" />Tọ adinenido nọ idem mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:12">dọk mfịd ima i-imiidiikpuuho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:12">nyʌñ dọk isọñ mfo a-awo imiikappake diin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:12">sia ini akem adiyem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:12">tutu anye adi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:12">anyʌñ uduọk fiin adinenido amọ nte mbara.<verse eid="HOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 10:13" />Ado afo amaatọ ibak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:13">anyʌñ adọk idiọọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:13">afo amedia mfịd ñkara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:13">Sia afo akenie idodanyen ke adudu mfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:13">ye ke uwak mbon ekọñ mfo,<verse eid="HOS 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 10:14" />ñkuun anwan ayaadakka adinwana ye mbon mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:14">nọ ato do esobo afịd ñkpọsọñ itie mfo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:14">naña Salman akebiat Bed Abel ke usen ekọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:14">ke ini eketọọñọ mme eka ye nditọ ammọ esuan ke isọñ.<verse eid="HOS 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 10:15" />Kpa ntoro ke adiitịppe unọ fiin, Beteel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:15">sia ibak mfo akpon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 10:15">Ke usen ado amaasiere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 10:15">eyaesobo adidem Isrel afịd-afịd.<verse eid="HOS 10:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HOS 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ima a-Abasi Anieghe Anọ Isrel</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 11:1" />“Idaha Isrel akedooho etəkayịn, ami mmaama anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:1">ami mmaakoot ayịn mmi nsio ke Iyib.<verse eid="HOS 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 11:2" />Ado naña ekekokoot ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:2">kpa naña ammọ ekesịkke eñkpọñ miin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:2">Ammọ emaenam uwa enọ mme Baal,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:2">emaenyʌñ efọp insensi enọ mme ubobodñkpọ.<verse eid="HOS 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 11:3" />Ami ndo andikikpeep Ifrem isañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:3">mmʌm ammọ ke ubọk mmi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:3">ado ammọ ikidiọọñọke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:3">ke ami ndo andikikọk ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 11:4" />Ami ñkedat ammọ usʌñ ye ima uduudawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:4">ye ndukoppo ima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:4">Ami ñkeba nte andidịppe nsekayịn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:4">ndian ke mbañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:4">ami mmaanyʌñ nnʌhọ nnọ ammọ ndidia.<verse eid="HOS 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 11:5" />“Nte ammọ idiitịmmeke inyọñ Iyib,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:5">nte Asiria ñko idiikaarake ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:5">sia ammọ esịn adikappa esịd?<verse eid="HOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 11:6" />Eyaetop akañkañ esịn ke mme abio ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:6">anye ayaasobo mme nsu-nsu prọfed ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:6">anyʌñ atre mme uduak ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 11:7" />Ikọd mmi ebiere adikanna edem iñkpọñ miin.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:7">Akpesʌkado a-ammọ eñkoodo miin Ñkoñ Ñkan Abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:7">ami ndiikanna ndịppe ammọ ke anyọñ.<verse eid="HOS 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 11:8" />“Ifrem, die ke ami ndiikan ndakka ukpọñ fiin?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:8">Isrel, ami ndiinam die usaana fiin ñyaak nnọ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">Die ke ami ndiinam ye afo nte Adma?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:8">Die ke ndiinam afo aba nte Seboyịm?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">Ke idem mmi, esịd mmi akpəho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:8">afịd mbọm mmi adakka ada.<verse eid="HOS 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 11:9" />Ami ndiinamma ñkpọ ke akpọsọñ iyadesịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:9">ndiinyʌññọ nsobo Ifrem aba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:9">Sia ami ndo Abasi, ndooho awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:9">Nsana Ñkan ke atu ndufo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:9">Ami ndiinamma mfịna ke mme abio ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 11:10" />Ammọ eyaekeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:10">anye ayaakuun nte ekpe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:10">Anye amaakuun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:10">nditọ amọ eyaeto edem usobutịn edi ye ñnyeñidem.<verse eid="HOS 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 11:11" />Ammọ eyaeto Iyib edi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:11">enyeñ idem nte mme nsiak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:11">eto Asiria edi, efuurọ nte ibiom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:11">Ami ñyaanam ammọ edʌñ ke mme ufọk ammọ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:11">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="HOS 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Idiọọkñkpọ Isrel</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 11:12" />Ifrem aben nsu añkanna miin akʌk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:12">Isrel akama ñkara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:12">Yuda ñko anam ñkpọ ntịme-ntịme ye Abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 11:12">anam kpa ye Adisana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke mme ikpañwed Hibru ewet ufañ ami Hos 11:12 nte Hos 12:1.</char></note> anam akpanikọ.<verse eid="HOS 11:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HOS 12" />
  <para style="q1">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">12: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke mme ikpañwed Hibru ewet Hos 12:1-14 nte Hos 12:2-15.</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 12:1" />Ifrem adia afịm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:1">anye abịne afịm usakkautịn afịd usen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:1">anyʌñ anam nsu ye afai etọt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:1">Anye anam edioomo adidiana keed ye Asiria,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:1">anyʌñ anọ adan ọlif esọk Iyib.<verse eid="HOS 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 12:2" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anie ikpe adikoot Yuda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:2">anye ayaamia Yekọb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yekọb </char><char style="ft" closed="false">awuọñọ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">anye ayịre ke itịghitịghi, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ke usem Hibru awuọñọ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">anye abiaña.</char></note> ufen akeene mme usʌñ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:2">anyʌñ anọ anye utịb akeene mme adinam amọ.<verse eid="HOS 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 12:3" />Anye asịne ke esịd idịb amʌm ayịneka amọ itịghitịghi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:3">nte awo anye amaada anwan ye Abasi.<verse eid="HOS 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 12:4" />Anye amaanwana ye enyere anyʌñ akan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:4">anye amaatua anyʌñ akpeiye anye abo yak inọ imọ adidiọñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:4">Anye amaakịt anye ke Beteel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:4">anyʌñ atañ ikọ ye anye do,<verse eid="HOS 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 12:5" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Andikponñkan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:5">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado anyịñ amọ!<verse eid="HOS 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 12:6" />Ado ana afo atịmme akeene Abasi mfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:6">tịm kama ima ye unenikpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:6">nyʌñ bet Abasi mfo afịd ini.<verse eid="HOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 12:7" />Anyamudua akama udomoñkpọ a-akwañake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:7">anyʌñ ama aditʌk awo.<verse eid="HOS 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 12:8" />Ifrem anam inua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:8">“Ami mmenekke nnie ñkpọ; ami mmemọinyọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:8">Ye afịd inie mmi ammọ idiikịtte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:8">ukwaññkpọ me idiọọkñkpọ ndomokeed ke idem mmi.”<verse eid="HOS 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 12:9" />“Ami mmedo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:9">tọọñọ ndufo eketo Iyib edi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:9">ami ñyaanam ndufo emaana edʌñ ke mme atayad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:9">kpa naña akesido ke mme usen usọrọ ndufo.<verse eid="HOS 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 12:10" />Ami mmaatañ ikọ ye mme prọfed,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:10">nnọ ammọ uwak ñkukịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:10">ñnyʌñ mboiyo ke inua ammọ ntañ ikọ ke ñke.”<verse eid="HOS 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 12:11" />Ado nte Kilied ado ibak?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:11">Mbon amọ iwuọñọke ñkpọ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 12:11">Nte ammọ esiwa ñyaaraenañ ke Kilkal?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:11">Mme akpokoro uwa ammọ edibit mme itiad e-ekoonoke ekọọk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:11">ke inwañ e-ekịmme isọñ ekappa.<verse eid="HOS 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 12:12" />Yekọb amaafeghe akaa idịd Aram;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:12">Isrel amaanam utom nọ abọ anwaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:12">nọ anye akpe ekọmudua amọ, akena anye akpeme edọñ.<verse eid="HOS 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 12:13" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeboiyo ke prọfed asio Isrel ke Iyib,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:13">aboiyo ke prọfed akama anye.<verse eid="HOS 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 12:14" />Ado Ifrem adịppe akpọsọñ idod iyadesịd amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:14">Abọọñ amọ ayaasaana ubiomikpe uduọk iyiib adot anye ke idem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 12:14">ayaanyʌñ anọ anye utịb emiom amọ.<verse eid="HOS 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HOS 13" />
  <para style="s1">Iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke Abaña Isrel</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 13:1" />Akesido Ifrem akpetañ ikọ, mme awo enyeñ idem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:1">emaekpono anye ke Isrel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:1">ado anye amaanam ndudue ke adikpono Baal anyʌñ akpa.<verse eid="HOS 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 13:2" />Idahami ammọ edọdiọñ enam idiọọkñkpọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:2">ammọ ekama silfa enam ubobodñkpọ enọ idem ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:2">mme ubobodñkpọ e-ekamake akpọsọñ ifiọk enam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:2">afịd ammọ edo ubọkutom mme anamusọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:2">Etañ ami ebaña mbon ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:2">“Ammọ ekama awo enam uwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:2">Ammọ etʌm mme ubobod enañ inua!”<verse eid="HOS 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 13:3" />Ke ntoro ammọ ediiba nte ntuhube ubakusen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:3">nte mbara usiere a-asoppo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:3">nte mbio abakpa a-afịm abenne ke afe ubeek abakpa asuan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:3">nte nsʌñikañ a-awuọhọ ke ubenafịm.<verse eid="HOS 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 13:4" />“Ado ami ñkesʌk ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:4">tọọñọ ndufo eketo Iyib ewuọ edi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:4">Ndufo idiidiọọñọke Abasi mfen ke imiibọhọke ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:4">idiinyʌññọ idiọọñọ andinyaaña mfen ke imiibọhọke ami.<verse eid="HOS 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 13:5" />Ami mmaikpeme ndufo ke anaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:5">ke isọñ akpọsọñ ufiob.<verse eid="HOS 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 13:6" />Idaha a-ami ñkenọọhọ ammọ ndidia, ammọ emaekop uyʌkkọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:6">ke ammọ emaekekop uyʌkkọ, ammọ emaetọọñọ ntañidem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:6">akem ammọ emfre miin anyen.<verse eid="HOS 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 13:7" />Ke ntoro ami ñyaaba nte ekpe nnọ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:7">ñnyʌñ ndịbe mbet ammọ ke usʌñ nte anawịdekpe.<verse eid="HOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 13:8" />Nte amọnikọd e-eyịppe nditọ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:8">ami ñyaanwana ñnyʌñ ñwai ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:8">nte ekpe ami ñyaata ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:8">idiọọk unamikọd ayaawai ammọ mbai-mbai.<verse eid="HOS 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 13:9" />“Isrel, afo amedʌk nsobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:9">sia afo ansuaha miin, asua andunọọ fiin unwam.<verse eid="HOS 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 13:10" />Mmọ adidem mfo, yak anye aduunyaaña fiin?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:10">Mmọ mme adaukara ke mme abio mfo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:10">a-afo akebooho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:10">‘Nnọ miin adidem ye ñkparawa ubọọñ’?<verse eid="HOS 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 13:11" />Ndin ke iyadesịd mmi, ami unọ fiin adidem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:11">ndin ke ifiobesịd mmi, ami ñko mben anye nsio.<verse eid="HOS 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 13:12" />Ebok idiọọkñkpọ Ifrem enịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:12">ewet ndiọiñkpọ amọ enịm.<verse eid="HOS 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 13:13" />Ubiak amọ aba nte ake awonwaan uman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:13">ado anye ado etəkayịn i-imiinieghe aniọñ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:13">ini amaadisịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:13">anye inieghe ifiọk adiwuọ ke idịb.<verse eid="HOS 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 13:14" />“Ami ñyaanyaaña mbon ami nsio ke adudu udi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:14">ami ñyaafak ammọ nsio ke ñkpa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:14">O ñkpa, mme udọñọ nsobo mfo eba ke mmọọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:14">O udi, nsobo mfo aba ke mmọọ?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HOS 13:14" />
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:14">“Ami ndiituaha mbọm,<verse eid="HOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 13:15" />akpesʌkado a-anye aforoke ke atu nditọeka amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:15">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanọ afịm nọ ato usakkautịn adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:15">afịme ato akpautatan adi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:15">idịm mmọọñ amọ ayaakpu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:15">ube mmọọñ amọ ñko ayaasat.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:15">Eyaebịme mme ñkpọuto amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:15">ke ufọkubonoñkpọ amọ.<verse eid="HOS 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 13:16" />Ana mbon Sameria eyọ ndudue ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:16">sia ammọ e-esọñ iwuod ye Abasi ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 13:16">Akañkañ ayaasobo ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:16">eyaeyaak ntək nditọ ammọ etọ esuan ke isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 13:16">eyaesai idịb ibaan ammọ eyommoke ekʌppọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke mme ikpañwed Hibru ewet ufañ ami Hos 13:16 nte Hos 14:1.</char></note>.”<verse eid="HOS 13:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="HOS 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ukappaesịd Ayaadat Adidiọñ Adi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">14: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke mme ikpañwed Hibru ewet Hos 14:1-9 nte Hos 14:2-10.</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 14:1" />Isrel, tịmme bịne <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:1">Ndiọiñkpọ mfo edo iduọ mfo!<verse eid="HOS 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 14:2" />Dat ikọ saña</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:2">nyʌñ tịmme bịne <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:2">Bo anye ate:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:2">“Dakka do ke afịd ndiọiñkpọ ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:2">nyʌñ iben ñnyịn ke mfọn mfo nọ idem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:2">yak ñnyịn inọ mfịd a-atooho ñkpọkinua ñnyịn utu ke ayaaraenañ.<verse eid="HOS 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 14:3" />Asiria ikemeke inyaaña ñnyịn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:3">ñnyịn idiidọọhọ anyọñ enañmbakara unwana ekọñ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:3">Tutu amama ñnyịn idiimaanake ibo ‘Mme abasi ñnyịn’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:3">ke mme ñkpọ se ubọk ñnyịn enam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:3">sia ke afo ke nditọakpa ebọ mbọm.”<verse eid="HOS 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 14:4" />“Ami ñyaakọk mfiakedem ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:4">ñnyʌñ mma ammọ ke ntadesịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:4">sia iyadesịd mmi amaawọññọ akpọñ ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 14:5" />Ami ndiiba nte mbara nnọ Isrel;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:5">anye ayaasakka nte lili.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:5">Nte sida ke Lebanọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:5">anye ayaasuuk adʌñ amọ;<verse eid="HOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 14:6" />ntək emịne amọ eyaekọt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:6">Uyai amọ adiiba nte eto ọlif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:6">inem ufịk amọ aba nte sida ke Lebanọn.<verse eid="HOS 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 14:7" />Mme awo eyaemaana ekeba ke idak mfuud amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:7">ammọ eyaeforo nte ñkwa abakpa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:7">ammọ eyaekọt nte fain,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:7">etob Isrel adiiba nte ukọd Lebanọn.<verse eid="HOS 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 14:8" />Ifrem, nsoo ndubeghe ke ami mmaana nnie ye mme ubobodñkpọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:8">Ami ñyaabọọrọ anye ñnyʌñ nse ñkpọ mbaña anye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:8">Ami mba nte nseghe eto yunipa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:8">nseghe mfo ato ke ami.”<verse eid="HOS 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 14:9" />Anie ado awo aniọñ? Yak ammọ ediọọñọ mme ñkpọ ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:9">Anie ado awo eti iwuod? Yak ammọ ebọ ifiọk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:9">Mme usʌñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> edo nnen-nnen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:9">ndinen awo esaña ke ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HOS 14:9">ado mbon nsọñiwuod efiọnnọ ke ammọ.<verse eid="HOS 14:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 14" />
</usx>